TI  - Versatile aerosol concentration enrichment system (VACES) for simultaneous in vivo and in vitro evaluation of toxic effects of ultrafine, fine and coarse ambient particles Part II: Field evaluation
PY  - 2001
T2  - Journal of Aerosol Science
VL  - 32
IS  - 11
