TI  - Development of hourly indoor pm2.5 concentration prediction model: The role of outdoor air, ventilation, building characteristic, and human activity
PY  - 2020
T2  - International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health
VL  - 17
IS  - 16
C7  - 5906
