TI  - A Prototype Feature Representation-Guided Multitask Learning Framework for Image-Based PM2.5Concentration Monitoring
PY  - 2026
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing
VL  - 64
C7  - 4109315
DO  - 10.1109/TGRS.2026.3704231
